vents, there shouldn\u2019t be interference with the game itself.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1460632826&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1589292043"}, "name": {"label": "Miguel \u00c1ngel Figueroa N\u00e1jera"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-22T14:07:12-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "15.72"}, "id": {"label": "14460147049"}, "title": {"label": "1 star"}, "content": {"label": "To laggy", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1460632826&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1922143116"}, "name": {"label": "\u1e9eum\u1e9e\u0142e\u1e9eeasT"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-20T21:48:50-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "15.72"}, "id": {"label": "14453460683"}, "title": {"label": "ZERO STARS REVIEW FOR BREACH OF CONTRACT"}, "content": {"label": "I\u2019ll also be submitting my claims and complaints with the \u201cVCC\u201d Since falcon games is based in Hanoi. I\u2019ll also be in contact with another legal body but I\u2019ll save that only for them. All you need to know is this kind of major escalation would never be here if these developers were morally sound. However, me spending most of my time with lots of different gaming bodies I\u2019ve learned there are good developers and also there are disgusting developers. This body has more disgusting trash than other troubling gaming bodies. So unless you enjoy being ph\u0173cked over just stay away. For your own peace of mind.", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1460632826&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1396289671"}, "name": {"label": "Ajayeah"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-20T21:46:37-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "15.72"}, "id": {"label": "14453455776"}, "title": {"label": "Amazing"}, "content": {"label": "Just try it!", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1460632826&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1760880300"}, "name": {"label": "Fercho1217"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-08-20T20:35:20-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "15.72"}, "id": {"label": "14453289862"}, "title": {"label": "Excelente"}, "content": {"label": "Excelente", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1460632826&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}], "updated": {"label": "2026-10-25T04:17:03-07:00"}, "rights": {"label": "Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title": {"label": "iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon": {"label": "http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link": [{"attributes": {"rel": "alternate", "type": "text/html", "href": "https://music.apple.com/WebObjects/MZS